{
  "survey": {
    "type": "survey",
    "id": "survey_service_satisfaction_post_submit_redirect",
    "title": "<h1>服务满意度回访</h1>",
    "description": "<p>你好，这是一份更贴近真实业务的服务回访问卷示例。系统会根据你的满意度分支，把你带到不同的结束页，并在<strong>提交成功后</strong>跳转到对应的后续动作页面。</p>",
    "attribute": {
      "onePageOneQuestion": true,
      "allowBack": true,
      "media": []
    }
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_service_scene",
      "title": "<h2>你本次体验的是哪类服务？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>用于帮助我们区分不同服务链路的体验差异。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_scene_online",
          "title": "<p>线上咨询 / 在线客服</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_scene_store",
          "title": "<p>到店服务 / 线下接待</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_scene_delivery",
          "title": "<p>上门 / 履约 / 配送服务</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_overall_level",
      "title": "<h2>你对本次服务的整体感受是？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>请选择最符合你当前体验的一项。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_level_positive",
          "title": "<p>满意，整体体验很好</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_level_neutral",
          "title": "<p>一般，还有优化空间</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_level_negative",
          "title": "<p>不满意，低于预期</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "score",
      "id": "question_positive_score",
      "title": "<h2>如果你满意，请为以下维度打分</h2>",
      "description": "<p>1 分最低，5 分最高。你的高分会帮助我们识别应该继续保持的服务能力。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_positive_speed",
          "title": "<p>响应速度</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_positive_professional",
          "title": "<p>专业程度</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_positive_result",
          "title": "<p>问题解决结果</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "question_neutral_gap",
      "title": "<h2>如果你觉得一般，最希望我们优先优化哪些地方？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>可多选，帮助我们判断优先优化方向。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_neutral_gap_speed",
          "title": "<p>效率还不够高</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_neutral_gap_clarity",
          "title": "<p>沟通说明不够清楚</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_neutral_gap_detail",
          "title": "<p>服务细节还可以更细致</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_neutral_gap_other",
          "title": "<p>其他，请说明</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] },
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "input",
              "id": "child_neutral_gap_other_text",
              "title": "<p>补充说明</p>",
              "attribute": {
                "required": true,
                "dataType": "text",
                "placeholder": "请补充你最想优化的地方",
                "maxLength": 200
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "question_negative_reason",
      "title": "<h2>如果不满意，主要问题出在哪些地方？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>可多选，我们会优先定位影响最大的环节。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_negative_reason_speed",
          "title": "<p>响应 / 处理速度慢</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_negative_reason_attitude",
          "title": "<p>服务态度不够好</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_negative_reason_result",
          "title": "<p>问题没有真正解决</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_negative_reason_other",
          "title": "<p>其他，请说明</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] },
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "input",
              "id": "child_negative_reason_other_text",
              "title": "<p>补充说明</p>",
              "attribute": {
                "required": true,
                "dataType": "text",
                "placeholder": "请补充更具体的问题",
                "maxLength": 200
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_negative_followup",
      "title": "<h2>我们是否可以安排专人继续跟进？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>仅用于处理本次问题，不会用于营销打扰。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_negative_followup_yes",
          "title": "<p>可以，请继续联系我</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_negative_followup_no",
          "title": "<p>暂时不用联系</p>",
          "attribute": { "media": [] }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "input",
      "id": "question_negative_contact",
      "title": "<h2>请留下你的联系方式</h2>",
      "description": "<p>仅在你同意回访时，用于售后专员继续处理本次问题。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_negative_contact_name",
          "title": "<p>姓名</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入你的姓名",
            "maxLength": 40
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_negative_contact_phone",
          "title": "<p>手机号</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "tel",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入方便联系的手机号",
            "maxLength": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "finish": [
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_positive_reward",
      "title": "<h2>感谢你的认可</h2>",
      "description": "<p>你的满意会帮助我们继续保持好的服务标准。提交成功后，我们会带你进入会员权益页，查看本次回访感谢福利。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/member-benefits",
        "mode": "immediate",
        "openIn": "blank"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_neutral_service_center",
      "title": "<h2>感谢你的建议</h2>",
      "description": "<p>我们已经收到你的优化方向。提交成功后，页面会带你进入服务中心，方便你继续查看常见服务方案。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/service-center",
        "mode": "delay",
        "delayMs": 2500,
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_negative_self_serve",
      "title": "<h2>很抱歉这次没能让你满意</h2>",
      "description": "<p>我们已记录你的问题。提交成功后，将带你进入自助处理入口，你可以随时继续查看进度或补充资料。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/self-service-case",
        "mode": "immediate",
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_negative_manual_support",
      "title": "<h2>我们会尽快安排专人跟进</h2>",
      "description": "<p>感谢你愿意留下联系方式。提交成功后，页面会跳转到人工售后入口，方便你继续查看处理说明。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/manual-support",
        "mode": "delay",
        "delayMs": 3000,
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    }
  ],
  "logic": [
    {
      "id": "logic_show_positive_score",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_level",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_level_positive"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_positive_score"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_positive_to_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_positive_score",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_positive_reward"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_neutral_gap",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_level",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_level_neutral"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_neutral_gap"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_neutral_to_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_neutral_gap",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_neutral_service_center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_negative_reason",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_level",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_level_negative"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_negative_reason"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_negative_followup",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_level",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_level_negative"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_negative_followup"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_negative_contact",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_negative_followup",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_negative_followup_yes"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_negative_contact"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_negative_no_followup_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_negative_followup",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_negative_followup_no"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_negative_self_serve"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_negative_contact_to_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_negative_contact",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_negative_manual_support"
      }
    }
  ]
}
